WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:04.776
Closure or next accepted transfer In this example the

00:00:04.789 --> 00:00:08.526
responsible person needs to close only after completion evidence

00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:13.303
or the next accepted transfer This example deliberately records

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:17.066
unresolved conditions instead of claiming a completed handover
